+/**************************************************************************//**
+ @Function      t_FmResetOnInitOverrideCallback
+
+ @Description   FMan specific reset on init user callback routine,
+                will be used to override the standard FMan reset on init procedure
+
+ @Param[in]     h_Fm  - FMan handler
+*//***************************************************************************/
