+                and redirect the receive flow to go through the
+                Dsar Fman-ctrl code
+
+ @Param[in]     h_DsarRxPort - FM Rx PORT module descriptor
+ @Param[in]     h_DsarTxPort - FM Tx PORT module descriptor
